00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:27.480
I was so embarrassed, I thought about killing myself.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:30.240
That's too weak a mentality for a martial artist.

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:36.490
I hoped everyone else would share
the same mindset, but that wasn't the case.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:39.370
No one else felt that way.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:44.950
Now they're saying that it's too scary,
so they should chop the tree down.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:53.080
Due to our lack of attention, we didn't notice this until now.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.900
