so this tree doesn't get chopped down?

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:10.150
Yeah.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:14.120
My request is that this tree stays right here,

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.850
and that it can stay forever.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.930
Forever, huh?

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:23.910
All right.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.350
Karen-chan,

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.050
